{"seq":1,"slug":"mcts-with-world-models","title":"MCTS 与世界模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/planning-in-world-models/mcts-with-world-models","wordCount":2146,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"mcts-与世界模型\">MCTS 与世界模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>蒙特卡洛树搜索（Monte Carlo Tree Search, MCTS）与世界模型的结合是 AlphaZero、MuZero 系列成功的核心技术。MCTS 把&quot;如何选择最好的动作&quot;问题转化为树搜索——在内部世界模型中模拟未来多步，构建带价值估计的搜索树，最终选择最佳动作。这种规划能力让智能体能进行深度多步推理，超越纯 model-free 反应式策略的能力上限。本节系统讲解 MCTS 的核心算法、与神经网络世界模型的集成、与近年的工程改进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[MCTS 四阶段] --&gt; B[选择 Selection]&#10;    A --&gt; C[扩展 Expansion]&#10;    A --&gt; D[模拟 Simulation]&#10;    A --&gt; E[反向传播 Backprop]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[UCB 选择子节点]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[到叶节点扩展]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[随机/价值估计]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[更新所有访问节点]\">graph TD\n    A[MCTS 四阶段] --&gt; B[选择 Selection]\n    A --&gt; C[扩展 Expansion]\n    A --&gt; D[模拟 Simulation]\n    A --&gt; E[反向传播 Backprop]\n    B --&gt; B1[UCB 选择子节点]\n    C --&gt; C1[到叶节点扩展]\n    D --&gt; D1[随机/价值估计]\n    E --&gt; E1[更新所有访问节点]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法变种</th>\n<th>模拟方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代表工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经典 MCTS</td>\n<td>随机 rollout 到终局</td>\n<td>完美信息游戏</td>\n<td>Computer Go</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AlphaGo MCTS</td>\n<td>神经价值函数 + rollout</td>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>AlphaGo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AlphaZero MCTS</td>\n<td>仅神经价值函数</td>\n<td>棋类</td>\n<td>AlphaZero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MuZero MCTS</td>\n<td>学到的世界模型</td>\n<td>通用决策</td>\n<td>MuZero, EfficientZero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sampled MuZero</td>\n<td>采样的连续动作 MCTS</td>\n<td>连续控制</td>\n<td>Sampled MuZero</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"经典-mcts-算法\">经典 MCTS 算法</h2><p>经典 MCTS 通过反复模拟构建决策树，每次模拟包含四个阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 选择（Selection）</strong>：从根节点出发，在每个内部节点用 UCB（Upper Confidence Bound）公式选择最有希望的子节点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UCB</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UCB}(s, a) = Q(s, a) + c \\sqrt{\\frac{\\ln N(s)}{N(s, a)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UCB</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1606em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8794em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1606em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(s, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该动作的平均价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(s, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该动作的访问次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是探索常数。这一公式平衡探索（访问次数少）与利用（价值高）。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 扩展（Expansion）</strong>：在叶节点上添加新的子节点（每个对应一个可能动作），用神经网络初始化它们的策略先验。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 模拟（Simulation）</strong>：从新节点出发用某种方式估计价值——经典 MCTS 用随机 rollout 到终局，AlphaZero 用神经网络直接给出价值，MuZero 用学到的世界模型展开。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 反向传播（Backpropagation）</strong>：把模拟得到的价值反向更新沿路径所有节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[根节点] --&gt; B[选择最佳路径]&#10;    B --&gt; C[到叶节点]&#10;    C --&gt; D[扩展子节点]&#10;    D --&gt; E[评估新叶子]&#10;    E --&gt; F[反向传播价值]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[根节点] --&gt; B[选择最佳路径]\n    B --&gt; C[到叶节点]\n    C --&gt; D[扩展子节点]\n    D --&gt; E[评估新叶子]\n    E --&gt; F[反向传播价值]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><p>每次完整模拟需要的计算量：选择 + 扩展（几次神经网络调用）+ 反向传播（几次更新）。AlphaGo / MuZero 通常做 50-1600 次模拟，相当于 50-1600 次神经网络调用。这一计算量决定了 MCTS 的实时性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"alphazero-mcts-神经价值函数引导\">AlphaZero MCTS：神经价值函数引导</h2><p>AlphaZero 把 MCTS 与深度神经网络深度结合：</p>\n<p><strong>策略先验</strong>：神经网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(a|s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，作为 MCTS 选择时的先验。 <strong>价值估计</strong>：神经网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，替代经典 MCTS 的随机 rollout。</p>\n<p>UCB 公式被修改为 PUCT（Predictor + UCB for Trees）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PUCT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>b</mi></munder><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PUCT}(s, a) = Q(s, a) + c \\cdot P(s, a) \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{\\sum_b N(s, b)}}{1 + N(s, a)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PUCT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.63em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7199em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9101em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8701em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3299em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一公式让神经网络学到的策略先验直接影响搜索。MCTS 把先验&quot;放大&quot;——好的动作被更多探索、坏的动作被快速排除。MCTS 后的访问分布作为新的策略目标，反过来训练神经网络。这种&quot;MCTS + 神经网络互相增强&quot;的循环是 AlphaZero 成功的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"muzero-mcts-基于学到的世界模型\">MuZero MCTS：基于学到的世界模型</h2><p>MuZero 把 AlphaZero 的&quot;已知规则&quot;假设去掉——它不需要游戏规则，而是从数据中学习一个内部世界模型，然后在内部模型上做 MCTS。这一改动让 MuZero 能应用到 Atari、推荐系统等没有显式规则的场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[MuZero MCTS] --&gt; B[h: 表征 o → s_0]&#10;    A --&gt; C[g: 动力学 s+a → s&#39;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[f: 预测 s → π, V]&#10;    B --&gt; E[根节点 s_0]&#10;    C --&gt; F[扩展时模拟下一状态]&#10;    D --&gt; G[每个节点的策略与价值]&#10;    E --&gt; H[标准 MCTS 流程]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[MuZero MCTS] --&gt; B[h: 表征 o → s_0]\n    A --&gt; C[g: 动力学 s+a → s']\n    A --&gt; D[f: 预测 s → π, V]\n    B --&gt; E[根节点 s_0]\n    C --&gt; F[扩展时模拟下一状态]\n    D --&gt; G[每个节点的策略与价值]\n    E --&gt; H[标准 MCTS 流程]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>MuZero 的内部模型不需要&quot;重建观察&quot;——它的隐状态只需要支撑奖励、价值、策略的准确预测。这种&quot;任务相关&quot;的世界模型让 MuZero 能在复杂环境（Atari）上学到有用的内部表征，而不被像素细节分散注意力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连续动作的-mcts-扩展\">连续动作的 MCTS 扩展</h2><p>经典 MCTS 假设离散动作空间——每个状态只有有限的可选动作。连续动作（机器人控制、游戏摇杆）让经典 MCTS 不再适用。两种主要扩展：</p>\n<p><strong>Sampled MuZero</strong>：在每个节点采样有限个连续动作（典型 K=8-32），把它们视为离散动作做 MCTS。简单但浪费——大部分采样动作可能远离最优。</p>\n<p><strong>Progressive Widening</strong>：动态决定何时增加新的连续动作候选——访问次数足够多时才扩展新动作。这让搜索能在已知好动作上深入，又能在需要时探索新动作。</p>\n<p><strong>MCTS + CEM 混合</strong>：用 CEM（Cross-Entropy Method）在每个节点优化连续动作分布，再用 MCTS 选择最优分布的动作。这种混合让连续动作的探索更高效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算优化与并行化\">计算优化与并行化</h2><p>MCTS 的计算量随模拟次数线性增长。为达到实时性需要多种工程优化：</p>\n<p><strong>虚拟损失（Virtual Loss）</strong>：并行化 MCTS 时，多线程同时探索可能选到同一节点。虚拟损失给已选路径添加临时惩罚，引导其他线程探索不同路径。</p>\n<p><strong>叶节点并行</strong>：同时扩展多个叶节点，批量调用神经网络。这把神经网络调用从串行变为并行，大幅提升 GPU 利用率。</p>\n<p><strong>根节点并行</strong>：用多个独立 MCTS 树搜索同一根状态，最后合并结果。简单且并行度高。</p>\n<p><strong>树重用</strong>：当智能体执行了某个动作后，对应的子树可以被复用——下一时刻的根节点就是当前根节点的某个子节点。这种重用让连续决策的总搜索成本降低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"efficientzero-样本效率突破\">EfficientZero：样本效率突破</h2><p>EfficientZero（南京大学，2021）通过几个关键改进让 MuZero 的样本效率显著提升，能在 Atari 100k benchmark（每个游戏只用 10 万帧）上达到人类水平：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自监督一致性损失</strong>：让世界模型在隐空间预测的下一隐状态与真实编码的下一隐状态一致。</li>\n<li><strong>价值前缀网络</strong>：直接预测整个 N 步的累积奖励，而不是逐步预测。</li>\n<li><strong>Off-policy 重分析</strong>：用最新模型重新评估老数据中的价值估计。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些改进让 MCTS + 世界模型范式在样本受限场景也变得实用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在产业中的应用\">在产业中的应用</h2><p>MCTS + 世界模型的产业应用：</p>\n<p><strong>游戏 AI</strong>：除了棋类，MCTS 在 StarCraft、Dota 等复杂实时战略游戏中也有应用。AlphaStar 等工作把 MCTS 与神经网络深度结合处理大规模动作空间。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐系统</strong>：YouTube 等公司用 MuZero 思路把推荐视为长期决策——不只优化当次点击，而是用 MCTS 规划&quot;未来 N 次推荐序列的总价值&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>化学合成</strong>：用 MCTS 在化学反应空间中搜索合成路径。每个节点是一个分子状态，每个动作是一种反应。AlphaFold 等思路在化学领域展开。</p>\n<p><strong>自动驾驶规划</strong>：在驾驶决策中用 MCTS 规划——把候选动作（变道、加速、减速）作为搜索树扩展，在世界模型中模拟后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键挑战\">关键挑战</h2><p>MCTS 在工程化中面临的挑战：</p>\n<p><strong>实时性约束</strong>：MCTS 通常需要 50-1600 次模拟才能给出高质量决策。在毫秒级控制场景（机器人闭环），这一时间预算太大。常见的应对是用神经策略做主决策，MCTS 只在关键时刻&quot;咨询&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>世界模型质量</strong>：MCTS 的决策质量上限由世界模型决定。如果世界模型在关键状态预测不准，MCTS 也无能为力。</p>\n<p><strong>探索效率</strong>：在巨大的搜索空间中，MCTS 可能在不重要的方向上浪费模拟。需要好的策略先验和探索 noise 设计。</p>\n<p><strong>记忆消耗</strong>：MCTS 的搜索树可能膨胀到数万节点，消耗大量内存。需要剪枝、节点淘汰等机制控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>MCTS 与世界模型的结合是当前最强的规划范式之一，从 AlphaZero 到 MuZero 再到 EfficientZero，方法不断进化。其核心思想——在内部世界模型中通过树搜索做深度推理——让智能体获得超越反应式策略的能力上限。理解 MCTS 的四阶段（选择、扩展、模拟、反向传播）与与神经网络的集成方式（PUCT、价值函数、世界模型）是任何 RL 研究者的必修课。MCTS 在棋类、Atari、推荐、化学等多样领域已经证明了价值，未来在自动驾驶、机器人控制、复杂决策场景的扩展前景广阔。把&quot;何时用 MCTS、何时用纯策略&quot;作为产品决策的核心权衡，能让具身智能系统在能力与实时性之间找到最佳平衡。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MCTS 与世界模型","id":"mcts-与世界模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"经典 MCTS 算法","id":"经典-mcts-算法"},{"level":2,"text":"AlphaZero MCTS：神经价值函数引导","id":"alphazero-mcts-神经价值函数引导"},{"level":2,"text":"MuZero MCTS：基于学到的世界模型","id":"muzero-mcts-基于学到的世界模型"},{"level":2,"text":"连续动作的 MCTS 扩展","id":"连续动作的-mcts-扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"计算优化与并行化","id":"计算优化与并行化"},{"level":2,"text":"EfficientZero：样本效率突破","id":"efficientzero-样本效率突破"},{"level":2,"text":"在产业中的应用","id":"在产业中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"关键挑战","id":"关键挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"物理AI与世界基础模型：Cosmos、Marble 与 Oasis","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/generative-video-as-world-model/world-foundation-models"},"next":{"title":"CEM 与 MPC：连续控制的规划方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/planning-in-world-models/cem-and-mpc"}}